description=Experimental desktop stereo and OpenXR head tracking for Viewpoint 0.1.3. Single player, first person, on foot. On-screen Off/Desktop/XR fixed/XR tracked controls; Pause/Break turns Off, Shift+Pause/Break saves a pair while Off. Five-second recenter and adjustable scale. Transparent headset panel includes game UI and Viewpoint overlays; desktop mouse/keyboard interaction. No VR controllers or tracked hands. See the included README for testing and limitations.
